//----------------------------------------------------------
// Information
// Turns the event on and sets how it is announced.
//   Debug log: 1 writes extra lines about the event to the log.
//   Enabled: Turns the event on or off.
//   Announce only in the map: The file calls this AnnounceAll; the GameServer reads it as AnnounceOnlyMap.
//   Block access to the zone: 1 keeps players out of the zone until the event allows it.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  Debug    Enable    AnnounceOnlyMap    BlockAccess
//----------------------------------------------------------
0
    1        1         1                  1
end

//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Settings
// The life and regeneration of the Ferea orb and the Lord of Ferea, and when the army and the revitalization come in.
//   Ferea orb: life recovered (%): Percentage of its maximum life the Ferea orb recovers each time.
//   Ferea orb: regen time (seconds): Seconds between one recovery of the orb and the next.
//   Lord of Ferea: life recovered (%): Percentage of its maximum life the Lord of Ferea recovers each time.
//   Lord of Ferea: regen time (seconds): Seconds between one recovery of the Lord of Ferea and the next.
//   Invoke army (%): The Lord of Ferea calls its army when its life falls to this percentage or below.
//   Revitalization: event time (minutes): Minutes after the event ends before it can open again.
//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~100]    [Number]        [0~100]     [Number]         [0~100]     [Number]
//  OrbLife    OrbRegenTime    BossLife    BossRegenTime    ArmyRate    RevitalizationTime
//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1
    5          5               5           5                60          5
end

//----------------------------------------------------------
// Boss Spawn Coordinates
// Where the Lord of Ferea appears: the area it is placed in.
//   From X: Left edge of the area.
//   From Y: Top edge of the area.
//   To X: Right edge of the area.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the area.
//   Direction: The way it faces, 0 to 8. Random picks one each time.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [*/0~8]
//  X          Y          X2         Y2         Dir
//----------------------------------------------------------
2
    26         122        28         124        3
end

//----------------------------------------------------------
// General Spawn Coordinates
// Where the other Ferea monsters appear.
//   From X: Left edge of the area.
//   From Y: Top edge of the area.
//   To X: Right edge of the area.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the area.
//   Direction: The way it faces, 0 to 8. Random picks one each time.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [*/0~8]
//  X          Y          X2         Y2         Dir
//----------------------------------------------------------
3
    29         116        38         130        3
end


