//----------------------------------------------------------
// Boss Skills
// The skills the Lord of Ferea uses.
//   Skill: The skill given to the Lord of Ferea. Which attack it is does not come from this number but from the position of the row: row 1 is Power Slash, row 2 Inferno, row 3 Weakness and row 4 a combo.
//   Chance (%): Chance of using it each time the boss attacks.
//   Time (seconds): Seconds before the boss can use it again.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [Number]    [0~100]    [Number]
//  Skill       Rate       Time
//----------------------------------------------------------
5
    56          85         2           //Power Slash
    14          60         3           //Inferno
    221         40         4           //Weakness
end